From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Lu=C3=ADs=20Duarte?= <lduarte@cloudflare.com>
Date: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 17:07:03 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] -webkit-box: flex-emulated layout + line-clamp line
 truncation

Map DisplayInside::WebkitBox to the flex container path (box-tree
construction, taffy style override with -moz-box-orient choosing the
main axis, traversal + table-context arms); stylo_taffy's fallback
made it Block, which broke every legacy-box layout.

For the clamp trio stylo rewrites display to flow-root and sets
IS_WEBKIT_LINE_CLAMP_CONTEXT; compute_inline_layout reads the flag
and truncates the parley layout to N lines after line breaking, so
the block's measured height and painted lines both clamp. No
ellipsis glyph yet: truncation only.

blitz-dom 0.3.0-beta.3 no longer stores a taffy style on
the node: Node::taffy_display maps -webkit-box to Flex, and the flexbox
container style is wrapped (FlexContainerStyle) so -moz-box-orient can
override flex-direction.
